# Commerce Checkout Redesign & Multi-Service Integration

## Outcome and purpose

Deliver a high-conversion, resilient checkout flow powered by Django SSR + HTMX with Playwright e2e validation.

---

## Tasks in this milestone

### task: backend-order-checkout-api

```yaml
task_ref: backend-order-checkout-api
target: "Implement idempotent order creation, stock reservation, and tax calculation endpoints in Django"
proof_policy: seam-test-first
contract_revision: 1
scope:
  - backend/src/checkout/services.py
  - backend/src/checkout/views.py
  - backend/tests/test_checkout_api.py
status: ready
subtasks:
  - subtask_ref: stock-reservation-seam-test
  - subtask_ref: idempotent-order-creation
  - subtask_ref: tax-calculation-service
```

### task: frontend-htmx-checkout-island

```yaml
task_ref: frontend-htmx-checkout-island
target: "Implement reactive checkout Island component with client validation and HTMX partial swaps"
proof_policy: seam-test-first
contract_revision: 1
scope:
  - frontend/src/views/checkout/island.html
  - frontend/src/views/checkout/payment_form.html
  - tests/e2e/checkout/test_checkout_flow.py
status: ready
subtasks:
  - subtask_ref: payment-form-swap-markup
  - subtask_ref: client-side-field-validation
  - subtask_ref: playwright-e2e-checkout-proof
```
